  data: {
    LLM: "Dealer deals 10 cards each; next card is trump, rest form stock. Player to dealer's right leads. Follow suit; must beat led suit if possible; if void must trump if possible. Trick winner draws first from stock, then opponent. After winning a trick you may declare one Cante (King+Horse of same suit: 40 in trumps, 20 in other). Declaring Tute (all four Kings or all four Horses) wins the deal. Last trick scores 10 extra. Most points wins the deal.",
    Player: "Dealer deals 10 cards each; next card is trump, rest form stock. Player to dealer's right leads. Follow suit; must beat led suit if possible; if void must trump if possible. Trick winner draws first from stock, then opponent. After winning a trick you may declare one Cante (King+Horse of same suit: 40 in trumps, 20 in other). Declaring Tute (all four Kings or all four Horses) wins the deal. Last trick scores 10 extra. Most points wins the deal.",
